{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 3,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 422.332,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I speak unto you, Joseph, my last-born.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.013,
      "end": 6.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou wast born in the wilderness of mine afflictions;",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.444,
      "end": 10.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in the days of my greatest sorrow did thy mother bear thee.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.071,
      "end": 16.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And may the Lord consecrate also unto thee this land, which is a most precious land,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 16.545,
      "end": 21.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thine inheritance and the inheritance of thy seed with thy brethren,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.112,
      "end": 24.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thy security forever,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.242,
      "end": 29.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that ye shall keep the commandments of the Holy One of Israel.",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.309,
      "end": 32.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Joseph, my last-born,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 32.765,
      "end": 36.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom I have brought out of the wilderness of mine afflictions,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.171,
      "end": 39.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "may the Lord bless thee forever,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.487,
      "end": 42.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thy seed shall not utterly be destroyed.",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.186,
      "end": 46.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, thou art the fruit of my loins;",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.338,
      "end": 50.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am a descendant of Joseph who was carried captive into Egypt.",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 50.837,
      "end": 54.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And great were the covenants of the Lord which he made unto Joseph.",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.372,
      "end": 57.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, Joseph truly saw our day.",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 57.967,
      "end": 60.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he obtained a promise of the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 60.423,
      "end": 62.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that out of the fruit of his loins",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 62.879,
      "end": 67.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord God would raise up a righteous branch unto the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.889,
      "end": 71.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not the Messiah, but a branch which was to be broken off,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.784,
      "end": 75.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, to be remembered in the covenants of the Lord",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 75.772,
      "end": 80.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Messiah should be made manifest unto them in the latter days,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 80.596,
      "end": 85.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the spirit of power, unto the bringing of them out of darkness unto light\u2014",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 85.606,
      "end": 87.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, out of hidden darkness",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 87.783,
      "end": 90.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and out of captivity unto freedom.",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 90.878,
      "end": 93.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For Joseph truly testified, saying:",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 93.38,
      "end": 100.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A seer shall the Lord my God raise up, who shall be a choice seer unto the fruit of my loins.",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 101.119,
      "end": 102.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, Joseph truly said:",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 102.971,
      "end": 104.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus saith the Lord unto me:",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 105.009,
      "end": 109.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A choice seer will I raise up out of the fruit of thy loins;",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 109.415,
      "end": 113.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall be esteemed highly among the fruit of thy loins.",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 113.31,
      "end": 115.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And unto him will I give commandment",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 116.044,
      "end": 120.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he shall do a work for the fruit of thy loins, his brethren,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 120.636,
      "end": 126.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall be of great worth unto them, even to the bringing of them to the knowledge of the covenants",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 126.993,
      "end": 129.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have made with thy fathers.",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 129.902,
      "end": 134.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will give unto him a commandment that he shall do none other work,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 134.494,
      "end": 137.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save the work which I shall command him.",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 137.182,
      "end": 139.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will make him great in mine eyes;",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 139.684,
      "end": 141.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he shall do my work.",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 142.129,
      "end": 144.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall be great like unto Moses,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 144.77,
      "end": 147.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom I have said I would raise up unto you,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 147.736,
      "end": 150.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to deliver my people, O house of Israel.",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 150.97,
      "end": 152.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Moses will I raise up,",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 153.147,
      "end": 155.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to deliver thy people out of the land of Egypt.",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 156.66,
      "end": 160.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But a seer will I raise up out of the fruit of thy loins;",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 160.462,
      "end": 166.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto him will I give power to bring forth my word unto the seed of thy loins\u2014",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 166.401,
      "end": 169.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not to the bringing forth my word only,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 169.367,
      "end": 170.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 170.894,
      "end": 173.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but to the convincing them of my word,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 173.396,
      "end": 176.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall have already gone forth among them.",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 176.862,
      "end": 179.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the fruit of thy loins shall write;",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 180.061,
      "end": 183.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the fruit of the loins of Judah shall write;",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 183.352,
      "end": 186.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that which shall be written by the fruit of thy loins,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 186.829,
      "end": 191.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that which shall be written by the fruit of the loins of Judah,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 191.792,
      "end": 195.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall grow together, unto the confounding of false doctrines",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 195.687,
      "end": 197.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and laying down of contentions,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 198.096,
      "end": 201.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and establishing peace among the fruit of thy loins,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 201.713,
      "end": 205.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bringing them to the knowledge of their fathers in the latter days,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 206.119,
      "end": 208.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also to the knowledge of my covenants,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 208.993,
      "end": 210.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 210.973,
      "end": 214.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And out of weakness he shall be made strong, in that day",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 214.59,
      "end": 219.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when my work shall commence among all my people, unto the restoring thee,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 219.275,
      "end": 220.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O house of Israel,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 220.941,
      "end": 222.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 222.921,
      "end": 225.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus prophesied Joseph, saying:",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 225.33,
      "end": 227.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, that seer will the Lord bless;",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 227.878,
      "end": 231.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they that seek to destroy him shall be confounded;",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 231.541,
      "end": 234.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for this promise, which I have obtained of the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 234.74,
      "end": 237.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of the fruit of my loins, shall be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 237.799,
      "end": 240.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am sure of the fulfilling of this promise;",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 241.312,
      "end": 243.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And his name shall be called after me;",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 243.675,
      "end": 246.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall be after the name of his father.",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 246.827,
      "end": 249.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall be like unto me;",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 249.236,
      "end": 257.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the thing, which the Lord shall bring forth by his hand, by the power of the Lord shall bring my people unto salvation.",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 257.718,
      "end": 259.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, thus prophesied Joseph:",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 259.802,
      "end": 261.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am sure of this thing,",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 261.468,
      "end": 264.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as I am sure of the promise of Moses;",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 264.434,
      "end": 266.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord hath said unto me,",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 266.75,
      "end": 269.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will preserve thy seed forever.",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 269.752,
      "end": 271.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord hath said:",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 271.557,
      "end": 273.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will raise up a Moses;",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 273.595,
      "end": 276.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will give power unto him in a rod;",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 276.329,
      "end": 279.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will give judgment unto him in writing.",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 279.481,
      "end": 281.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet I will not loose his tongue,",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 281.704,
      "end": 283.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he shall speak much,",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 283.602,
      "end": 286.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I will not make him mighty in speaking.",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 286.243,
      "end": 291.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I will write unto him my law, by the finger of mine own hand;",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 291.346,
      "end": 293.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will make a spokesman for him.",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 294.627,
      "end": 296.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord said unto me also:",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 297.083,
      "end": 299.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will raise up unto the fruit of thy loins;",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 300.096,
      "end": 302.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will make for him a spokesman.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 302.784,
      "end": 305.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, behold, I will give unto him",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 305.332,
      "end": 310.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he shall write the writing of the fruit of thy loins, unto the fruit of thy loins;",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 311.038,
      "end": 313.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the spokesman of thy loins shall declare it.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 314.458,
      "end": 316.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the words which he shall write",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 317.006,
      "end": 323.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be the words which are expedient in my wisdom should go forth unto the fruit of thy loins.",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 323.966,
      "end": 329.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall be as if the fruit of thy loins had cried unto them from the dust;",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 329.347,
      "end": 330.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I know their faith.",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 331.56,
      "end": 336.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall cry from the dust; yea, even repentance unto their brethren,",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 336.198,
      "end": 338.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even after many generations have gone by them.",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 339.118,
      "end": 342.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that their cry shall go,",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 342.363,
      "end": 345.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even according to the simpleness of their words.",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 345.737,
      "end": 347.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Because of their faith",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 347.403,
      "end": 350.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their words shall proceed forth out of my mouth",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 350.927,
      "end": 354.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto their brethren who are the fruit of thy loins;",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 354.265,
      "end": 356.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the weakness of their words",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 356.906,
      "end": 358.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will I make strong in their faith,",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 359.176,
      "end": 363.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto the remembering of my covenant which I made unto thy fathers.",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 363.943,
      "end": 366.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, my son Joseph,",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 366.538,
      "end": 369.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after this manner did my father of old prophesy.",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 370.469,
      "end": 373.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, because of this covenant thou art blessed;",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 373.714,
      "end": 376.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thy seed shall not be destroyed,",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 376.216,
      "end": 379.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall hearken unto the words of the book.",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 380.286,
      "end": 383.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there shall rise up one mighty among them,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 383.392,
      "end": 385.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who shall do much good,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 385.197,
      "end": 387.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both in word and in deed,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 387.327,
      "end": 390.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being an instrument in the hands of God, with exceeding faith,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 391.083,
      "end": 392.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to work mighty wonders,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 392.888,
      "end": 401.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do that thing which is great in the sight of God, unto the bringing to pass much restoration unto the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 401.984,
      "end": 404.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto the seed of thy brethren.",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 404.986,
      "end": 407.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, blessed art thou, Joseph.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 407.209,
      "end": 408.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, thou art little;",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 409.061,
      "end": 412.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore hearken unto the words of thy brother, Nephi,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 412.631,
      "end": 414.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall be done unto thee",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 414.947,
      "end": 417.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even according to the words which I have spoken.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 418.099,
      "end": 420.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Remember the words of thy dying father.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 420.833,
      "end": 421.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 129
    }
  ]
}